[
  {
    "id": "flow-webos-example",
    "type": "tab",
    "label": "LG webOS TV example",
    "disabled": false,
    "info": "Example flow for controlling and monitoring an LG webOS TV with a single lg-tv node.\n\n1. Open the lg-tv node and enter the TV's IP and MAC address.\n2. On the TV, enable Settings -> General -> Mobile TV On so Wake-on-LAN works.\n3. Deploy. The first time, accept the pairing prompt on the TV screen.\n\nThe lg-tv node accepts on/off/toggle on its input and emits the TV power state on its output whenever it changes.\n\nPicture settings\n----------------\nThe two scheduled injects switch the panel between a bright daytime look and a dim, warm night-time one (OLED Pixel Brightness plus the Reduce Blue Light toggle). Adjust the times in each inject's Repeat setting.\n\nThese only apply while the TV is ON -- a write that lands while it is off fails, which shows up on the node's status and in the debug sidebar. Brightness is stored per picture preset and separately for SDR/HDR, so add \"pictureMode\" to the payload if the result has to be deterministic.\n\nThe last inject reads the current values back with the raw ssap:// escape hatch."
  },
  {
    "id": "inj-tv-on",
    "type": "inject",
    "z": "flow-webos-example",
    "name": "Turn ON",
    "props": [
      {
        "p": "payload"
      }
    ],
    "repeat": "",
    "crontab": "",
    "once": false,
    "onceDelay": 0.1,
    "topic": "",
    "payload": "on",
    "payloadType": "str",
    "x": 150,
    "y": 120,
    "wires": [
      [
        "tv-node"
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "inj-tv-off",
    "type": "inject",
    "z": "flow-webos-example",
    "name": "Turn OFF",
    "props": [
      {
        "p": "payload"
      }
    ],
    "repeat": "",
    "crontab": "",
    "once": false,
    "onceDelay": 0.1,
    "topic": "",
    "payload": "off",
    "payloadType": "str",
    "x": 150,
    "y": 180,
    "wires": [
      [
        "tv-node"
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "inj-tv-toggle",
    "type": "inject",
    "z": "flow-webos-example",
    "name": "Toggle",
    "props": [
      {
        "p": "payload"
      }
    ],
    "repeat": "",
    "crontab": "",
    "once": false,
    "onceDelay": 0.1,
    "topic": "",
    "payload": "toggle",
    "payloadType": "str",
    "x": 150,
    "y": 240,
    "wires": [
      [
        "tv-node"
      ]
    ]
